* Does the order matter? The answer

#lang go

    compose(square, inc)(3) // square(inc(3)) = 16
    compose(inc, square)(3) // inc(square(3)) = 10

- Composition is not commutative
- `compose(g,` `f)` reads from right to left like (g ◦ f): first f, then g

